WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.077
After training, a model can generate a prediction for a new row—as long as the new row has the same feature structure

00:00:10.077 --> 00:00:17.677
used during training. The example contains four feature values because the model was trained with four input features.

00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:25.258
Predict returns the class, and predict_proba returns estimated class probabilities.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:33.979
The largest probability is printed as a confidence-like value, but remember that a probability estimate is not a

00:00:33.979 --> 00:00:37.822
guarantee. New data must be prepared in the same way as the training data.
